WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.498 --> 00:00:04.833
DENIED THAT POSITIVE EXPERIENCE.

00:00:04.834 --> 00:00:07.469
&gt;&gt; Shannon: THANK YOU VERY MUCH.

00:00:07.470 --> 00:00:10.105
&gt;&gt; IN TONIGHT'S WHATEVER

00:00:10.106 --> 00:00:11.006
HAPPENED TO SEGMENT.

00:00:11.007 --> 00:00:13.442
THE REMAINS OF AMERICAN WAR

00:00:13.443 --> 00:00:15.277
HEROES RETURNED FROM NORTH

00:00:15.278 --> 00:00:15.744
KOREA.

00:00:15.745 --> 00:00:18.981
IT LOOKED LIKE THERE WAS A

00:00:18.982 --> 00:00:20.682
SIGNIFICANT BREAK THROUGH BUT

00:00:20.683 --> 00:00:21.316
THE OUTLOOK HAS CHANGED.

00:00:21.317 --> 00:00:23.385
&gt;&gt; ♪ ♪

00:00:23.386 --> 00:00:26.388
&gt;&gt; IT'S BEEN MORE THAN 6 MONTHS

00:00:26.389 --> 00:00:27.356
SINCE NORTH KOREA TURNED OVER 55

00:00:27.357 --> 00:00:29.525
BOXES CONTAINING THE REMAINS OF

00:00:29.526 --> 00:00:31.860
SOME OF AMERICA'S HEROES FROM

00:00:31.861 --> 00:00:32.628
THE KOREAN WAR.

00:00:32.629 --> 00:00:36.298
&gt;&gt; OUR BOYS ARE COMING HOME.

00:00:36.299 --> 00:00:43.305
THEY ARE NOT KNOWN BUT SOON WE

00:00:43.306 --> 00:00:46.208
WILL KNOW THEIR NAMES.

00:00:46.209 --> 00:00:49.278
&gt;&gt; NORTH KOREA HAS NOT TURNED

00:00:49.279 --> 00:00:51.980
ANY MORE.

00:00:51.981 --> 00:00:53.248
7500 MISSING AMERICANS, MORE

00:00:53.249 --> 00:00:55.050
THAN TWO-THIRDS REMAIN IN NORTH

00:00:55.051 --> 00:00:56.952
KOREA WITH THE OTHERS FURTHER

00:00:56.953 --> 00:00:57.252
SOUTH.

00:00:57.253 --> 00:00:59.321
&gt;&gt; WE WOULD BE DELIGHTED IF WE

00:00:59.322 --> 00:01:00.722
COULD GET MORE RETAINS TURNED

00:01:00.723 --> 00:01:02.758
OVER TO US.

00:01:02.759 --> 00:01:04.760
THERE HAS BEEN NO DISCUSSION IN

00:01:04.761 --> 00:01:07.529
THE LAST -- SINCE WE RECEIVED

00:01:07.530 --> 00:01:09.264
THE 55 BOXES.

00:01:09.265 --> 00:01:13.468
&gt;&gt; IN HIS FIRST SUMMIT WITH

00:01:13.469 --> 00:01:16.338
PRESIDENT TRUMP NORTH KOREA

00:01:16.339 --> 00:01:19.308
LEADER KIM JONG-UN COMMITTED TO

00:01:19.309 --> 00:01:20.709
RECOVERING FOR REMAINS.

00:01:20.710 --> 00:01:23.345
THE SUBJECT NEVER CAME UP IN

00:01:23.346 --> 00:01:26.181
PUBLIC MEETINGS BETWEEN

00:01:26.182 --> 00:01:27.115
PRESIDENT TRUMP AND CHAIRMAN KIM

00:01:27.116 --> 00:01:27.516
IN VIETNAM.

00:01:27.517 --> 00:01:28.517
ONLY 3 AMERICANS HAVE BEEN

00:01:28.518 --> 00:01:30.953
IDENTIFIED FROM THE BOXES SO

00:01:30.954 --> 00:01:31.220
FAR.

00:01:31.221 --> 00:01:32.221
DR. BIRD SAID MORE AMERICANS

00:01:32.222 --> 00:01:34.056
WILL BE IDENTIFIED IN THE DAYS

00:01:34.057 --> 00:01:34.356
AHEAD.

00:01:34.357 --> 00:01:37.626
&gt;&gt; WE ARE IN THE FINAL STAGES OF

00:01:37.627 --> 00:01:38.894
MAKING SEVERAL MORE

00:01:38.895 --> 00:01:39.361
IDENTIFICATIONS.

00:01:39.362 --> 00:01:41.496
WE ARE LOOKING AT 4.

00:01:41.497 --> 00:01:42.998
&gt;&gt; HE SAID BASED ON DNA RESULTS,

00:01:42.999 --> 00:01:45.734
UP TO 80% OF THE REMAINS TURNED

00:01:45.735 --> 00:01:47.569
OVER ARE AMERICANS.

00:01:47.570 --> 00:01:49.504
ULTIMATELY DOZENS MORE ARE

00:01:49.505 --> 00:01:51.673
EXPECTED TO BE IDENTIFIED.

00:01:51.674 --> 00:01:54.676
HE DESCRIBED PAIN STAKING

00:01:54.677 --> 00:01:55.010
METHODS.

00:01:55.011 --> 00:01:56.144
&gt;&gt; AMERICAN SOLDIERS IN THE

00:01:56.145 --> 00:01:58.247
KOREAN WAR WOULD HAVE A VERY

00:01:58.248 --> 00:01:59.314
DIFFERENT DIET.

00:01:59.315 --> 00:02:04.319
WHEN WE LOOK BACK AT THE BONES,

00:02:04.320 --> 00:02:06.221
WE CAN RECOGNIZE AMERICAN

00:02:06.222 --> 00:02:08.190
REMAINS FROM THE SIGNATURES IN

00:02:08.191 --> 00:02:12.996
THE BONES.

